{"event": "agent_result", "task": "single-agent", "role": "single_agent", "result": {"report": {"incident_id": "sheets-discovery-039", "outcome": "probable_cause", "hypotheses": [{"description": "Most likely cause: Sheets tool discovery was truncated to the default first page, so the required action was omitted even though it exists in the current catalog. The failing request returned 20 tools with has_more=true, and the requested tool was explicitly on a later page. In a controlled sandbox comparison with provider mocked, the original condition still failed and the corrected condition succeeded after completing pagination.", "supporting_evidence": ["ev_9b152f02d7f9", "ev_154da898e8ad", "ev_e2138419ef7e"], "contradicting_evidence": [], "confidence": "high", "assumptions": ["The cedar production request used the same discovery pattern as the reproduced original condition.", "The missing action complaint refers to the later-page tool identified in the telemetry."]}, {"description": "Alternative explanation: a current provider outage caused the missing action. This is weak because the provider API was reachable, another Google Sheets-related read was available at the same time, and the controlled reproduction failed even with a provider mock until pagination was completed.", "supporting_evidence": ["ev_53d065c564c9"], "contradicting_evidence": ["ev_9b152f02d7f9", "ev_154da898e8ad", "ev_63cc0806cce6"], "confidence": "low", "assumptions": ["The unrelated successful provider read is representative enough to rebut a broad provider outage claim."]}, {"description": "Observed impact was tenant-specific to cedar rather than a platform-wide outage: cedar had blocked business operations, backlog, and elevated latency, while maple had zero blocked operations and normal queue depth at the same timestamp.", "supporting_evidence": ["ev_2eae34a8d8ef", "ev_9b152f02d7f9"], "contradicting_evidence": [], "confidence": "high", "assumptions": ["The comparison tenant used sufficiently similar discovery flows to serve as a health control."]}], "recommended_actions": ["tool_discovery_truncation_remediation", "If pagination cannot be used, increase the discovery limit enough to include the required Sheets action and verify the exact returned action slug.", "monitor_provider", "collect_missing_telemetry"], "limitations": ["No direct request body or code-path trace shows exactly why cedar stopped at the first page; the diagnosis relies on request/result telemetry plus controlled reproduction.", "Only limited tenant comparisons are available; conclusions are scoped to the observed cedar requests during the incident window.", "Historical outage evidence is analogy only and not proof for this incident."]}, "ranked_cause_codes": ["tool_discovery_truncation", "provider_failure", "unconfirmed_change"], "findings": [{"code": "mechanism_observation", "statement": "At 2026-11-12T10:05:00Z, the affected cedar request returned 20 Google Sheets tools with has_more=true, and the required tool was recorded as being on a later page even though the current version contained it.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "ev_9b152f02d7f9", "record_id": "sheets-discovery-039:logs:0"}]}, {"code": "controlled_comparison", "statement": "In controlled sandbox observations with provider mocked, the original condition still failed while the corrected condition passed after pagination completed and the requested tool was found, discriminating pagination/truncation from provider availability.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "ev_154da898e8ad", "record_id": "sheets-discovery-039:reproduce:0"}, {"evidence_id": "ev_154da898e8ad", "record_id": "sheets-discovery-039:reproduce:1"}]}, {"code": "tenant_impact", "statement": "Impact was concentrated in cedar: 380 business operations blocked, queue depth 108, and p95 latency 1440 ms, versus maple with 0 blocked operations, queue depth 0, and p95 latency 160 ms at the same time.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "ev_2eae34a8d8ef", "record_id": "sheets-discovery-039:metrics:0"}, {"evidence_id": "ev_2eae34a8d8ef", "record_id": "sheets-discovery-039:metrics:1"}]}, {"code": "provider_isolation", "statement": "Current evidence does not support a broad provider outage: provider API reachability was true, and a same-provider unrelated read succeeded for a comparison tenant during the incident window.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "ev_63cc0806cce6", "record_id": "sheets-discovery-039:dependencies:0"}, {"evidence_id": "ev_9b152f02d7f9", "record_id": "sheets-discovery-039:logs:1"}]}, {"code": "verification_control", "statement": "Public reference material for the Google Sheets toolkit matches the observed mechanism by noting that discovery may return only the default first page unless pagination is followed or a larger limit is requested.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "ev_e2138419ef7e", "record_id": "sheets-discovery-039:knowledge:0"}]}], "action_codes": ["tool_discovery_truncation_remediation", "monitor_provider", "collect_missing_telemetry"]}}
